description:
Write three functions:

```javascript
function fizzBuzz(n) { }        // array for 1..n: "Fizz" for multiples of 3, "Buzz" of 5, "FizzBuzz" of both, else the number as a string
function dayType(day) { }       // "Sat"/"Sun" -> "weekend", "Mon"-"Fri" -> "weekday", anything else -> "unknown" (use switch)
function collatzSteps(n) { }    // steps to reach 1: halve even numbers, 3n + 1 for odd ones (use while)
```

